playStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-6\"><span class=\"s2049134SENU\">23A-38-6</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049134SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2049134CL\">Counsel for indigent defendants in contempt cases.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049134Normal-000000\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">In any proceeding conducted under § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-1\"><span class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-1</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">, </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-2\"><span class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">, or </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-5\"><span class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-5</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">, including all necessary appeals, counsel shall be appointed as provided in chapter </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-40\"><span class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-40</span></a><span class=\"s2049134DefaultParagraphFont\">.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049134Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049134000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049134Normal\"><span class=\"s2049134SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049134SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 480.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049135Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049135SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049135CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2049135Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049135DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049135000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049135SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049135SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049135Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-7\"><span class=\"s2049135SENU\">23A-38-7</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049135SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2049135CL\">Bail pending appeal from order of confinement--Expeditious disposition of appeal.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049135Normal-000000\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049135DefaultParagraphFont\">Any person confined pursuant to § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-1\"><span class=\"s2049135DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-1</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049135DefaultParagraphFont\"> or </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-2\"><span class=\"s2049135DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049135DefaultParagraphFont\"> shall be admitted to bail or released in accordance with chapter </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-43\"><span class=\"s2049135DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-43</span></a><span class=\"s2049135DefaultParagraphFont\">, pending the determination of an appeal taken by him from the order of his confinement unless it affirmatively appears that the appeal is frivolous or taken for delay. Any appeal from an order of confinement under this section shall be disposed of as soon as practicable, and in no event more than thirty days from the filing of such appeal.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049135Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049135000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049135Normal\"><span class=\"s2049135SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049135SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 475.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049136Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049136SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049136CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2049136Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049136DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049136000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049136SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049136SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049136Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-8\"><span class=\"s2049136SENU\">23A-38-8</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049136SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2049136CL\">Place of confinement of person held in contempt.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049136Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2049136DefaultParagraphFont\">Any confinement shall be at a suitable correctional facility within the circuit in which the sentencing court is located. Upon a showing of need or hardship the court ordering confinement may grant a request by the witness to be imprisoned at a suitable correctional facility near the place of residence or employment of the witness, or the witness' family or relatives or the attorney of the witness.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049136Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049136000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049136Normal\"><span class=\"s2049136SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049136SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 474.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049137Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049137SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049137CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2049137Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049137DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049137000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049137SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049137SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049137Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-9\"><span class=\"s2049137SENU\">23A-38-9</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2049137CL\">Subsequent punishment for contempt permitted on subsequent refusal to provide information.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049137Normal-000000\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\">A person fined or imprisoned under § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-2\"><span class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\"> or </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-5\"><span class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-5</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\"> for refusal to testify or provide other information concerning any transaction, set of transactions, event, or events in a proceeding before a court or grand jury of this state, may be again fined, imprisoned, or both, under § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-2\"><span class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\"> or </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-5\"><span class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-5</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137DefaultParagraphFont\"> for a subsequent refusal to testify or provide other information concerning the same transaction, set of transactions, event, or events.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049137Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049137Normal\"><span class=\"s2049137SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049137SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 479.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2049138Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049138SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049138CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2049138Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049138DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049138000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049138SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2049138SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049138Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-10\"><span class=\"s2049138SENU\">23A-38-10</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049138SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2049138CL\">Service of prisoner's sentence tolled for refusal to testify in certain proceedings--Prisoner defined.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049138Normal-000000\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049138DefaultParagraphFont\">If a prisoner is confined for contempt pursuant to § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-1\"><span class=\"s2049138DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-1</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049138DefaultParagraphFont\">, </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-2\"><span class=\"s2049138DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-2</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049138DefaultParagraphFont\">, or </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-38-5\"><span class=\"s2049138DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-38-5</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049138DefaultParagraphFont\"> for refusal, without just cause, to comply with an order to testify or provide other information in a proceeding before a court or grand jury, the period during which the prisoner remains in contempt may not be deemed service of the prisoner's sentence. The term \"prisoner\" as used in this section includes any person incarcerated for the purpose of serving a sentence after conviction of a criminal offense.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049138Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049138000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2049138Normal\"><span class=\"s2049138SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2049138SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1988/195/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1988, ch 195\">SL 1988, ch 195</a>.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html></head></html>","Credits":null,"StatuteText":null,"Article":null,"Created":null,"CreatedById":null,"LastUpdated":null,"LastUpdatedBy":null,"Repealed":false,"StatuteReferencesReferencesStatute":[],"StatuteReferencesStatute":[]}